9
00:00:45,400 --> 00:00:50,679
a whale, the body may get loose from the ship by reason of a violent storm, and

10
00:00:50,680 --> 00:00:57,238
drifting far away to lure, be retaken by a second whaler, who in a calm, snuggly

11
00:00:57,239 --> 00:01:02,914
